<LanguageData>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Title>模组设置</ProtossMech.Settings.Title>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Combat>战斗</ProtossMech.Settings.Combat>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Gunsmith>枪匠</ProtossMech.Settings.Gunsmith>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Compatibility>状态兼容</ProtossMech.Settings.Compatibility>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.CombatDesc>调整机械体的特殊战斗功能。</ProtossMech.Settings.CombatDesc>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.GunsmithDesc>调整枪匠功能与私人配件微调。</ProtossMech.Settings.GunsmithDesc>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.CompatibilityDesc>勾选允许作用于本模组机械体的健康状态。</ProtossMech.Settings.CompatibilityDesc>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Overheat>启示录：净化者巨像</ProtossMech.Settings.Overheat>
