  <ProtossMech.Settings.UmbraFocusDesc>开启后，渊影进入斩形态时自动启用集中模式，以按键手动控制。</ProtossMech.Settings.UmbraFocusDesc>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.Title>集中模式键位</ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.Title>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.Description>点击按键修改。方向键按屏幕方向移动并逐渐转向；弧形显示实际朝向。退出后切回曲刃。</ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.Description>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.MoveForward>向屏幕上方移动</ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.MoveForward>
  <ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.MoveBack>向屏幕下方移动</ProtossMech.Settings.Focus.MoveBack>
